<title>USA: Leslie Fay exits Chap 11 as two entities.</title>
<headline>Leslie Fay exits Chap 11 as two entities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leslie Fay Cos Inc on Wednesday said it was emerging from bankruptcy protection as two separate companies, as stipulated under a reorganization plan that took effect at 1700 EDT/2100 GMT Wednesday.</p>
<p>Under the plan, approved by the U.S. Bankruptcy Court for the Southern District of New York, the company is separating into Leslie Fay Co Inc and Kasper ASL Ltd, and the equity in Leslie Fay Cos Inc is being extinguished.</p>
